{%- render 'hs2-head' -%}
{%- liquid
  assign s = section.settings
  # The order-by date shows only once it is confirmed in "Last order date for Christmas":
  # [DATE] in the memo becomes that date. Until then the bar shows the line without a date.
  assign msg = s.text
  assign when = s.deadline | strip
  if when != blank
    assign nice = when | date: '%B %-d'
    assign msg = msg | replace: '[DATE]', nice
  elsif msg contains '[DATE]'
    assign msg = s.text_undated
  endif
  # The shipping line is the same on every page (Krish, 27 Oct 2026). A memo saved in the theme
  # editor before then can still end "Free US shipping."; finish it.
  assign msg = msg | replace: 'Free US shipping.', 'Free US shipping on every order.'
  # Fast shipping, said first and clearly in the strip (Krish, 6 Nov: "the homepage needs to say Fast Shipping at the
  # top, really clearly in the top banner"). A deal line saved in the theme editor before then still reads
  # "Free US shipping"; finish it the same way.
  assign deal = s.offer_deal | replace: 'Free US shipping', 'Fast, free US shipping'
-%}
{%- comment -%}
  The memo bar also carries the store-wide dates that drive every countdown on the
  site (hs2.js reads them from data-* here): the confirmed last order date and the
  launch offer window. With no last order date, the countdowns count to Christmas
  morning, which is always true.
  It shows as one 32px strip on night above the cream header, on every page and on
  phones too (hs-brand.css, "the announcement strip").
{%- endcomment -%}
<div class="hs2">
  {%- assign artist = s.artist_touch_product -%}
  {%- comment -%} The printed Christmas card from the dog (Krish, 31 Oct): offered while its product is available and
    until 11:59 pm Eastern on Thursday 3 December 2026 (1796360399), by the server's clock. hs2.js checks the same
    moment again, for a page served from cache; the product is set unavailable then too, and the order workflow
    refuses a card placed after it. {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- liquid
    assign card = s.card_product
    assign hs_now = 'now' | date: '%s' | plus: 0
    assign card_open = false
    if card != blank and card.available and hs_now < 1796360399
      assign card_open = true
    endif
  -%}
  <div class="hs2-memo hs-strip{% if s.offer_on %} hs-strip--offer{% endif %}" data-hs2-memo{% if s.bundle_offer_live %} data-hs-bundle-live{% endif %}{% if artist != blank and artist.available %} data-hs-artist-variant="{{ artist.selected_or_first_available_variant.id }}" data-hs-artist-price="{{ artist.price | money_without_trailing_zeros | escape }}"{% endif %}{% if card_open %} data-hs-card-variant="{{ card.selected_or_first_available_variant.id }}" data-hs-card-price="{{ card.price | money_without_trailing_zeros | escape }}" data-hs-card-until="1796360399"{% endif %} data-deadline="{{ s.deadline | strip | escape }}" data-offer-start="{{ s.offer_start | strip | escape }}" data-offer-end="{{ s.offer_end | strip | escape }}" data-offer-label="{{ s.offer_label | escape }}">
    {%- comment -%} The Christmas offer (Krish, 3 Nov: one offer, not two). While "offer_on" is ticked the strip is the
      offer itself, in the logo heart's pink: the badge line with hs2.js's countdown, then free shipping and, only
      while the bundle switch says the discount exists, the saving. It sits still; no ticker. Unticked, it is the
      one-line memo below. {%- endcomment -%}
    {%- if s.offer_on -%}
    <div class="hs2-memo__viewport">
      <p class="hs2-memo__top"><span class="hs2-memo__msg">{{ s.offer_title | escape }}</span><span class="hs2-memo__count" data-hs2-countdown="memo" hidden></span></p>
      <p class="hs2-memo__deal">{{ deal | escape }}{% if s.bundle_offer_live and s.offer_bundle != blank %}<span aria-hidden="true"> · </span>{{ s.offer_bundle | escape }}{% endif %}</p>
    </div>
    {%- else -%}
    <div class="hs2-memo__viewport">
      <div class="hs2-memo__track" data-hs2-ticker>
        <span class="hs2-memo__item"><span class="hs2-memo__msg">{% render 'hs2-t', text: msg %}</span><span class="hs2-memo__count" data-hs2-countdown="memo" hidden></span></span>
      </div>
    </div>
    {%- endif -%}
  </div>
  {%- comment -%} The "one more gift" drawer, on the cart page only (Krish, 5 Nov): data and its script, no height. {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- if template.name == 'cart' -%}{% render 'hs-cart-more', products: all_products, root: routes.root_url %}{%- endif -%}
  {%- comment -%} Buddy's help, bottom right on every page (Krish, 10 Nov): off while the address is empty. {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- render 'hs-help', url: section.settings.help_url -%}
</div>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "HS memo bar",
  "tag": "section",
  "class": "hs2-section",
  "enabled_on": {
    "templates": [
      "*"
    ],
    "groups": [
      "header"
    ]
  },
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "offer_on",
      "label": "Show the Christmas offer in the strip",
      "info": "Krish, 3 Nov: the strip is the one offer on every page. Off: the one-line memo below.",
      "default": true
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "offer_title",
      "label": "Offer: badge line",
      "info": "The countdown to the last order date (or Christmas morning) follows it.",
      "default": "Christmas offer"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "offer_deal",
      "label": "Offer: the deal",
      "default": "Fast, free US shipping"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "offer_bundle",
      "label": "Offer: the saving",
      "info": "Shows only while the bundle switch below is ticked, which is only once the Shopify automatic discount exists.",
      "default": "15% off 2 gifts, 20% off 3"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "text",
      "label": "Memo",
      "info": "One message: the order-by date and free shipping. [DATE] becomes the last order date below, once it is set.",
      "default": "Order by [DATE] for Christmas delivery. Free US shipping on every order."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "text_undated",
      "label": "Memo until the last order date is set",
      "info": "Shows while the date below is empty, so the bar never shows [DATE].",
      "default": "Free US shipping on every order."
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Countdowns (whole site)"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "deadline",
      "label": "Last order date for Christmas",
      "info": "As YYYY-MM-DD, for example 2026-12-10. Only once Printful's dashboard confirms it. Empty: the countdowns count to Christmas morning instead."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "offer_start",
      "label": "Free video offer starts",
      "info": "YYYY-MM-DD. docs/V2-FROM-THE-DOG.md section 4: the read-aloud video is free with any order from 20 October to 1 November. Empty switches the offer off.",
      "default": "2026-10-20"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "offer_end",
      "label": "Free video offer ends (last day)",
      "default": "2026-11-01"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "offer_label",
      "label": "Offer wording on the read-aloud button",
      "default": "Free until November 1"
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "bundle_offer_live",
      "label": "Show the bundle saving (15% off two gifts, 20% off three)",
      "info": "The one switch for the chat, the product pages and the cart. Tick only once the Shopify automatic discount exists and matches; until then no saving is shown anywhere.",
      "default": false
    },
    {
      "type": "product",
      "id": "artist_touch_product",
      "label": "Artist's touch add-on",
      "info": "The paid hand rework offered on each personalised cart line (adds 5 days). Empty, or a product that isn't available, hides the offer everywhere."
    },
    {
      "type": "product",
      "id": "card_product",
      "label": "Printed Christmas card add-on",
      "info": "The $12 card from the dog, offered with each gift until 11:59 pm Eastern on 3 December 2026. Empty, or a product that isn't available, hides it everywhere."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "help_url",
      "label": "Help chat address",
      "info": "The webhook of the n8n workflow \"Heartside: help chat (Buddy)\" (n8n/HELP-CHAT.md). Empty hides Buddy's help button on every page."
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "HS memo bar"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
